    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-27" id="fn-27" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">To record the cost recovery of CCA compliance costs related to electric Schedule 111, consistent with Washington Commission Dockets UE-250321.</link:footnote>
